OL,3,GNEWSAThe communities travelling miles
OL,4,Ato dispose of waste
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans to reopen a tip near Keighley
OL,7,Fhave been welcomed by the community -
OL,8,Fbut across West Yorkshire, some
OL,9,Fresidents are travelling miles to
OL,10,Fdispose of their waste.
OL,12,FSugden End Recycling Centre will reopen
OL,13,Flater this year, with Bradford Council
OL,14,Fdiverting #400,000 from culture
OL,15,Ffunding, it was confirmed last week.
OL,17,FMeanwhile, people in Ilkley and
OL,18,FBirstall have told of the struggles
OL,19,Fthey face with fewer facilities.
OL,21,F"People in the Wharfe Valley are just
OL,22,Fstuck," says Steve Walker.
